  ('h2', 1, 'Augustus regierte ab 27 v. Chr. Caesar war Diktator, aber nie Kaiser.', '{"en":{"explanation":"Augustus ruled from 27 BC. Caesar was dictator but never emperor."}}'::jsonb),
